    title_en: "Wanda Pet suspected of personal data leak: Clients report receiving contact via third-party emails, company launches investigation",
    summary_en: "Listed pet retail company Wanda Pet (6968) issued a major announcement on September 19, stating it received reports from clients regarding suspected third-party acquisition of their consumption data, which was subsequently used for contact via email. The company preliminarily assessed that this incident may involve a personal data leak. In response, Wanda Pet immediately preserved data from relevant systems and launched an internal investigation. Notably, Wanda Pet had previously issued a security alert at the end of July, disclosing that its partner vendor's information system had been compromised, suggesting a partial data leak. Whether these two incidents are related remains pending further clarification from Wanda Pet.",
