    title: "網通設備友訊遭外部攻擊者偵測異常登入，啟動緊急應變機制進行系統檢視",
    summary: "網通設備公司友訊於9月18日透過公開資訊觀測站發布重大訊息，揭露公司網站監控機制偵測到異常登入記錄。經調查，外部攻擊者利用既有的登入機制，以大量帳號密碼進行網站登入驗證，屬於暴力破解或帳密猜測攻擊。友訊隨即啟動緊急應變機制，執行了系統登入記錄清查、封鎖可疑連線，並對全站程式碼進行安全檢視。目前公司表示，尚未再發現相同異常登入行為，網站服務仍維持正常運作。根據初步評估，友訊認為此次事件對其營運並無重大影響。建議相關企業應強化網站的帳號密碼驗證機制，並實施異常登入行為的監控與阻斷機制。",
    tags: ["友訊", "網站安全", "異常登入", "暴力破解", "資安事件"],
    title_en: "Youshun Detects Suspicious Login Attempts from External Attackers on Linkelec Equipment, Initiates Emergency Response",
    summary_en: "On September 18, Linkelec Equipment Co., Ltd. issued a major announcement via the Public Information Observation Station, revealing that the company's website monitoring system detected abnormal login records. Investigations found that external attackers utilized existing login mechanisms to perform website login validations using a large volume of accounts and passwords, indicative of brute-force or credential guessing attacks. Youshun immediately activated its emergency response mechanism, conducting a thorough review of system login records, blocking suspicious connections, and performing a security review of the entire site's code. The company currently reports that no similar abnormal login activity has been detected, and website services remain operational. Based on preliminary assessments, Youshun believes this incident has no significant impact on its operations. The company recommends that related enterprises strengthen their website's account and password verification mechanisms and implement monitoring and blocking mechanisms for abnormal login behavior.",
