    title: "科羅拉多州供水系統遭外國攻擊者入侵，攻擊目標為OT設備與關鍵基礎設施",
    summary: "美國科羅拉多州兩家小型私人供水公司，在8月底遭到外國攻擊者的入侵。攻擊者透過修改設備設定、停用遠端存取與警報系統，並改變抽水週期，意圖干擾供水系統的穩定運作。雖然這次攻擊的影響時間短暫，並未造成供水服務或公共安全問題，但事件凸顯了關鍵基礎設施的脆弱性。此事件延續了自7月以來美國供水系統持續遭受攻擊的趨勢。聯邦調查局及CISA已發出警告，指出攻擊者正鎖定暴露於網際網路的可程式化邏輯控制器（PLC）等OT設備。專家提醒，由於供水系統攸關民生，業者應加強OT網路的隔離、實施嚴格的存取控制，並強化對PLC等工業控制系統的監控與安全措施，以應對國家級的網路威脅。",
    tags: ["科羅拉多州", "供水系統", "OT設備", "PLC", "關鍵基礎設施", "CISA"],
    title_en: "Colorado Water System Breached by Foreign Attackers, Targeting OT Equipment and Critical Infrastructure",
    summary_en: "Two small private water utility companies in Colorado, USA, were breached by foreign attackers at the end of August. The attackers attempted to disrupt the stable operation of the water supply system by modifying equipment settings, disabling remote access and alarm systems, and altering pumping cycles. Although the impact of this attack was brief and did not cause service disruption or public safety issues, the incident highlights the vulnerability of critical infrastructure. This event continues the trend of ongoing attacks against US water systems since July. The FBI and CISA have issued warnings, noting that attackers are targeting Operational Technology (OT) equipment, such as Programmable Logic Controllers (PLCs), exposed to the internet. Experts recommend that due to the essential nature of water supply, operators must strengthen OT network isolation, implement strict access controls, and enhance monitoring and security measures for industrial control systems like PLCs to counter national-level cyber threats.",
    tags_en: ["Colorado", "Water System", "OT Equipment", "PLC", "Critical Infrastructure", "CISA"],
    sources: [
      { name: "iThome", url: "https://ithome.com.tw/news/179109", lang: "ZH-TW" }
    ]
