    category: "Linux",
    title: "阿里巴巴投入 300 萬美元支持 Omarchy，打造「理想型」代理式 Linux 作業系統",
    summary: "Omarchy 專案宣布，阿里巴巴雲（Alibaba Cloud）將向其基金會捐贈總計 300 萬美元，用於開發這個 Linux 發行版，並致力於將其打造為「理想型代理式作業系統」（ideal agentic operating system）。此舉是阿里巴巴雲對 DigitalOcean 每年 100 萬美元捐款的匹配，為期三年。此外，阿里巴巴雲也將協助建立 Omarchy China，提供本地 CDN、託管服務和活動支持。雙方目標是讓 Omarchy 成為一個美觀、有趣的 Linux 桌面，讓使用者和 AI 代理（agents）能夠協同工作，且使用者仍掌握主導權。具體規劃包括為 Qwen 模型進行調校，並實現與中國本地服務的全面整合，確保模型、作業系統和服務能夠從開機瞬間就協同運作。",
    tags: ["Alibaba Cloud", "Omarchy", "Linux", "Agentic OS", "Qwen", "Linux 發行版"],
    title_en: "Alibaba Invests $3 Million to Support Omarchy, Building an 'Ideal Agentic' Linux Operating System",
    summary_en: "The Omarchy project announced that Alibaba Cloud will donate a total of $3 million to its foundation to develop the Linux distribution, aiming to establish it as an 'ideal agentic operating system.' This contribution matches Alibaba Cloud's three-year commitment, mirroring DigitalOcean's annual $1 million donation. Furthermore, Alibaba Cloud will assist in establishing Omarchy China, providing local CDN, hosting services, and event support. The goal for both parties is to make Omarchy a visually appealing and engaging Linux desktop that allows users and AI agents to collaborate while maintaining user control. Specific plans include fine-tuning for the Qwen model and achieving comprehensive integration with local Chinese services, ensuring that the model, operating system, and services work together seamlessly from the moment of boot.",
    tags_en: ["Alibaba Cloud", "Omarchy", "Linux", "Agentic OS", "Qwen", "Linux Distribution"],
    sources: [
      { name: "Phoronix", url: "https://phoronix.com/news/Omarchy-Alibaba-3M", lang: "EN" }
    ]
