    summary: "Linux 7.3 核心的 HID 子系統（HID subsystem）提交了新的修復和設備驅動程式支援。這些更新將在 Linux 7.3-rc5 核心發行版中合併。本次更新主要增加了對多款周邊設備的支援，包括 Logitech G502 X Lightspeed USB 滑鼠，使其能透過 USB 連接並完整運作；Elecom M-XT4DRBK（一款左手款軌跡球）也獲得了支援；此外，SteelSeries HID 驅動程式新增了對 Arctis 7 (2018) 耳機的支援，使其能報告連接和電池狀態。此外，本次修復也包含針對 ASUS ROG Flow Z13 (2025) GZ302EA 筆電的觸控板手掌偵測錯誤修復，以及為 Lenovo Yoga Slim 7x Gen 11 筆電鍵盤新增的特殊處理（quirk）。這些更新提升了 Linux 系統對周邊硬體的相容性與功能性。",
    tags: ["Linux 7.3", "HID subsystem", "Logitech G502 X", "Elecom M-XT4DRBK", "Linux 核心"],
    title_en: "Linux 7.3 Kernel Update: Adds Support for Peripherals like Logitech G502 X and Elecom M-XT4DRBK",
    summary_en: "The HID subsystem in the Linux 7.3 kernel has submitted new fixes and device driver support. These updates will be merged into the Linux 7.3-rc5 kernel release. This update primarily adds support for multiple peripheral devices, including the Logitech G502 X Lightspeed USB mouse, allowing it to connect and function fully via USB; Elecom M-XT4DRBK (a left-handed trackball) also received support; furthermore, the SteelSeries HID driver added support for the Arctis 7 (2018) headset, enabling it to report connection and battery status. Additionally, this fix includes a correction for touchpad palm detection errors on the ASUS ROG Flow Z13 (2025) GZ302EA laptop, and a new quirk for the Lenovo Yoga Slim 7x Gen 11 laptop keyboard. These updates enhance the compatibility and functionality of Linux systems with peripheral hardware.",
    tags_en: ["Linux 7.3", "HID subsystem", "Logitech G502 X", "Elecom M-XT4DRBK", "Linux Kernel"],
