    title: "SUSE 宣布「自願分離」計畫，重塑企業結構並調整員工陣容",
    summary: "資安媒體 The Register 報導指出，資深 Linux 供應商 SUSE 正在進行業務結構重塑，並向符合資格的長期員工提供「自願分離」（voluntary separation）和早期退休選項。此計畫旨在將公司業務結構與長期戰略優先事項對齊。SUSE 代表表示，參與此計畫完全自願，且員工仍是公司關鍵差異化因素。此舉發生在公司舉行線上會議之後，引起了業界關注。此外，文章提到 SUSE 的產品線也正在經歷重大變化，例如 openSUSE Leap 16 版本移除多個傳統工具，並引入了與 Red Hat 相關的替代方案，如 Cockpit web management interface，顯示其正在朝向更現代、更精簡的 Linux 發行版方向發展。這些人事與產品的變動，反映了 SUSE 在市場轉型和戰略調整上的重大決策。",
    tags: ["SUSE", "Linux", "openSUSE Leap 16", "自願分離", "企業轉型", "Red Hat"],
    title_en: "SUSE Announces 'Voluntary Separation' Plan to Reshape Corporate Structure and Workforce",
    summary_en: "Cybersecurity media outlet The Register reported that the veteran Linux vendor SUSE is undergoing a business restructuring, offering 'voluntary separation' and early retirement options to eligible long-term employees. This plan aims to align the company's operational structure with its long-term strategic priorities. A SUSE representative stated that participation in this program is entirely voluntary and that employees remain a critical differentiator for the company. This announcement followed an online company meeting and has drawn industry attention. Furthermore, the article noted significant changes in SUSE's product lines, such as openSUSE Leap 16 removing several traditional tools and introducing Red Hat-related alternatives, such as the Cockpit web management interface, indicating a shift toward a more modern and streamlined Linux distribution. These personnel and product changes reflect SUSE's major decisions regarding market transition and strategic adjustment.",
