    category: "法規與標準",
    title: "Comp AI 完成 3,400 萬美元 A 輪募資，擴展 GRC 平台至資安監控與 AI 代理安全",
    summary: "Comp AI 宣布完成 3,400 萬美元的 A 輪募資，旨在強化其業務範圍。該公司最初專注於提供治理、風險與法規遵循（GRC）自動化平臺，目前已服務超過 1,000 家客戶，並支援 SOC 2、ISO 27001、HIPAA、GDPR 及 FedRAMP 等多項法規標準。募資資金將用於擴展服務至即時安全監控、應用程式及基礎架構的安全測試，包括 AI 驅動的滲透測試。此外，Comp AI 也將重點發展 AI 代理安全，特別關注 AI 代理的權限管理與當責（accountability）問題，協助企業掌握 AI 代理的存取資源與操作範圍，確保其行為不超出授權範圍。",
    tags: ["Comp AI", "GRC", "ISO 27001", "GDPR", "AI 代理安全", "資安監控"],
    title_en: "Comp AI Completes $34 Million Series A Funding to Expand GRC Platform into Security Monitoring and AI Agent Security",
    summary_en: "Comp AI announced the completion of $34 million in Series A funding to strengthen its business scope. The company initially focused on providing Governance, Risk, and Compliance (GRC) automation platforms, currently serving over 1,000 clients and supporting multiple regulatory standards including SOC 2, ISO 27001, HIPAA, GDPR, and FedRAMP. The raised funds will be used to expand services into real-time security monitoring and security testing for applications and infrastructure, including AI-driven penetration testing. Furthermore, Comp AI will focus on developing AI agent security, specifically addressing AI agent permission management and accountability, helping enterprises control the resources and operational scope of AI agents to ensure their behavior remains within authorized limits.",
