    id: "20260922-13110",
    trackers: ["security"],
    category: "漏洞與威脅情報",
    title: "Flatpak xdg-dbus-proxy 存在廣播訊息過濾繞過漏洞 (GHSA-r7hp-698j-2h6c)",
    summary: "Flatpak 的 xdg-dbus-proxy 元件在版本 0.1.6 和 0.1.7 中，因廣播訊息過濾的實作有誤，導致存在一個安全漏洞。此漏洞已被分配 CVE-2026-93676。該漏洞允許攻擊者繞過原本的廣播訊息過濾機制，可能導致未經授權的訊息處理或系統行為異常。建議使用者應立即升級 xdg-dbus-proxy 至修復版本，以修補此個安全缺陷，確保系統的訊息傳遞安全性和完整性。由於原文未提供詳細的CVSS評分或影響範圍，建議使用者應參考 Flatpak 官方的修補公告進行升級。",
    tags: ["Flatpak", "xdg-dbus-proxy", "CVE-2026-93676", "GHSA-r7hp-698j-2h6c", "廣播訊息過濾"],
    title_en: "Flatpak xdg-dbus-proxy Vulnerable to Broadcast Message Filtering Bypass (GHSA-r7hp-698j-2h6c)",
    summary_en: "The xdg-dbus-proxy component within Flatpak, specifically in versions 0.1.6 and 0.1.7, contains a security vulnerability due to an incorrect implementation of broadcast message filtering. This vulnerability has been assigned CVE-2026-93676. The flaw allows an attacker to bypass the intended broadcast message filtering mechanism, potentially leading to unauthorized message processing or abnormal system behavior. Users are advised to immediately upgrade xdg-dbus-proxy to the patched version to mitigate this security defect, ensuring the safety and integrity of system message transmission. As the original source did not provide detailed CVSS scores or scope of impact, users should refer to the official Flatpak patch announcement for upgrade guidance.",
    tags_en: ["Flatpak", "xdg-dbus-proxy", "CVE-2026-93676", "GHSA-r7hp-698j-2h6c", "Broadcast Message Filtering"],
