    summary_en: "The weather application RadarScope, a professional-grade radar visualization tool designed for iPhone, has been updated to support the Apple CarPlay platform. RadarScope is a powerful weather application that provides high-resolution data from over 300 radar stations, allowing users to track severe weather phenomena. The new CarPlay interface is not merely a basic port; it incorporates several advanced features, notably the ability to overlay navigation system data (such as MRMS, spot radar, and satellite maps) with radar data. This is extremely useful for professionals and enthusiasts tracking cyclones or conducting weather warnings. Furthermore, when the vehicle is moving and the spot radar function is used, the system automatically switches to data from the nearest radar station, significantly enhancing the in-car user experience. Users can download the application via the App Store.",
