    category: "Apple",
    title: "iOS 27 系統通知錯誤：iCloud 儲存空間提示無法移除的紅色徽章",
    summary: "部分使用 iOS 27 系統的用戶，可能會遇到一個惱人的通知錯誤。該錯誤會在「設定」App 上顯示一個紅色的徽章，提示用戶「啟動 iCloud 儲存空間」。令人困擾的是，即使用戶已經擁有足夠的 iCloud 儲存空間（例如使用 2 TB 的 Apple One 家庭方案），這個錯誤通知仍然會出現，且點擊後只是導向購買 iCloud 儲存空間的頁面，無法透過關閉通知來移除這個紅色的徽章。這是一個純粹的系統顯示或通知邏輯錯誤，不涉及資安漏洞，但影響了用戶的介面體驗。",
    tags: ["iOS 27", "iCloud", "設定 App", "Apple One", "系統錯誤"],
    title_en: "iOS 27 System Notification Error: Persistent Red Badge for iCloud Storage Space",
    summary_en: "Some users running iOS 27 may encounter an annoying notification error. This error displays a red badge on the 'Settings' app, prompting the user to 'Activate iCloud Storage Space.' What is frustrating is that even if the user already has sufficient iCloud storage (for example, using a 2 TB Apple One family plan), this error notification still appears. Furthermore, clicking it only directs the user to the page for purchasing iCloud storage, and there is no way to remove the red badge by dismissing the notification. This is purely a system display or notification logic error and does not involve a security vulnerability, but it does affect the user's interface experience.",
