    id: "20260922-13186",
    trackers: ["os"],
    category: "Apple",
    title: "watchOS 27.2 Beta 2 重磅回歸 App Switcher，新增螢幕長按手勢供用戶快速切換應用程式",
    summary: "Apple 為開發者發布了 watchOS 27.2 beta 2 版本，該版本修復了用戶長期期待的功能。在 watchOS 27 版本中，快速切換應用程式（App Switcher）的功能曾因移除 Digital Crown 的雙擊手勢而讓部分用戶感到不便。雖然 watchOS 27.2 beta 2 並未恢復 Digital Crown 的雙擊快捷鍵，但它透過新增一個新的手勢來重新引入了 App Switcher。用戶現在只需在應用程式內長按螢幕底部，即可呼出 App Switcher。App Switcher 的基本操作邏輯與以往相似，用戶仍可透過轉動 Digital Crown 瀏覽最近使用的應用程式，或向左滑動應用程式並點擊「X」按鈕進行移除。此功能目前僅在 Beta 版本中測試，最終正式版是否會保留此手勢，仍待觀察。此更新顯示 Apple 正在積極回應用戶回饋，改善用戶體驗。",
    tags: ["watchOS", "Apple Watch", "App Switcher", "Digital Crown", "Beta 測試"],
    title_en: "watchOS 27.2 Beta 2 Revamps App Switcher with New Long-Press Gesture for Quick App Switching",
    summary_en: "Apple has released watchOS 27.2 beta 2 for developers, featuring a highly anticipated functional update. In watchOS 27, the App Switcher functionality caused inconvenience for some users due to the removal of the Digital Crown double-click gesture. Although watchOS 27.2 beta 2 has not restored the Digital Crown double-click shortcut, it reintroduces the App Switcher by adding a new gesture. Users can now invoke the App Switcher simply by long-pressing the bottom of the screen within an application. The basic operational logic of the App Switcher remains similar to previous versions; users can still browse recently used applications by rotating the Digital Crown or remove applications by swiping left and tapping the 'X' button. This feature is currently only available for testing in the Beta version, and whether the final official release will retain this gesture remains to be seen. This update demonstrates Apple's proactive effort to incorporate user feedback and improve the overall user experience.",
    tags_en: ["watchOS", "Apple Watch", "App Switcher", "Digital Crown", "Beta Testing"],
    sources: [
      { name: "9to5Mac", url: "https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/21/watchos-27-2-beta-2-brings-the-app-switcher-back-with-a-new-gesture", lang: "EN" }
    ]
