    summary: "Adobe Premiere，這款原先在桌面端廣受好評的專業影片編輯套件，現已正式推出 Android 版本。此版本與先前在 iPhone 上發布的應用程式相同，旨在提供一個功能強大的跨平台解決方案。主要功能包括增強音訊（如降噪、清理語音）、多軌時間軸管理、客製化模板、特效（包含 Adobe Stock 整合）以及支援高達 4K 的編輯與輸出。該應用程式已支援多種 Android 設備和外形，特別優化了摺疊手機。值得注意的是，Adobe Premiere for Android 採用免費模式，用戶無需訂閱 Creative Cloud 或面對廣告和浮水印。雖然 Adobe 提及未來將增加更多功能，例如支援 Adobe Fonts、專案轉移至 Premiere Pro 桌面版、節拍偵測等，但用戶需注意，運行此應用程式需要至少 5GB RAM 和 Android 13 或更新版本。",
    tags: ["Adobe Premiere", "Android", "影片編輯", "跨平台", "Creative Cloud"],
    title_en: "Adobe Premiere Cross-Platform Release: Android Version Supports Multi-Layer Editing and Foldable Phone Optimization",
    summary_en: "Adobe Premiere, a professional video editing suite previously popular on desktop platforms, has officially launched an Android version. This version mirrors the application released for iPhone, aiming to provide a powerful cross-platform solution. Key features include enhanced audio tools (such as noise reduction and voice cleanup), multi-track timeline management, customizable templates, effects (including Adobe Stock integration), and support for editing and exporting up to 4K. The application supports various Android devices and form factors, with special optimization for foldable phones. Notably, Adobe Premiere for Android operates in a free mode, meaning users do not require a Creative Cloud subscription or face ads and watermarks. While Adobe mentioned plans to add more features in the future, such as support for Adobe Fonts, project transfer to Premiere Pro desktop, and beat detection, users should note that running the application requires at least 5GB of RAM and Android 13 or newer.",
