    summary_en: "Apple Music recently announced the opening of a new live music venue in London, located at the Battersea Power Station, named Apple Music Hall. The venue has a capacity of approximately 600 people and will serve as a stage for exclusive, single-night concerts by artists. All performance content will be streamed live for all Apple Music subscribers to watch. The venue has established an official website, and fans can register there to receive notifications when the first batch of tickets goes on sale. This news is primarily commercial and entertainment information and is unrelated to cybersecurity or technical vulnerabilities, requiring no remediation advice.",
