    title: "Xbox 進行重大組織重組：Halo 品牌將由 Activision 接管，整合旗下多個遊戲工作室",
    summary: "Xbox 宣布進行大規模的內部工作室重組，旨在打破各遊戲團隊過度獨立的運作模式，以推動更一致的開發目標。其中最顯著的變動是，旗下的 Halo 遊戲系列將由《使命召喚》（Call of Duty）的開發商 Activision 接管。原 Halo Studios（前身為 343 Industries）將縮減為一個小型團隊，主要負責支持玩家社群。Activision 總裁 Rob Kostich 表示，目標是打造史上最偉大的 Halo 遊戲，並已開始組建一個專門的團隊來實現這一宏大目標。此外，Activision 也將接管歷史悠久的 Rare 工作室（《海盜戰記》）以及 World's Edge 負責的《帝國歷程》系列。這項重組反映了 Xbox 在遊戲部門進行的全面「重置」與結構調整。",
    tags: ["Xbox", "Activision", "Halo", "遊戲產業", "組織重組", "343 Industries"],
    title_en: "Xbox Undergoes Major Organizational Restructuring: Halo Brand to be Managed by Activision, Integrating Multiple Game Studios",
    summary_en: "Xbox has announced a large-scale internal studio restructuring aimed at breaking the pattern of overly independent operations among various game teams, thereby promoting more consistent development goals. The most notable change is that the Halo franchise will be taken over by Activision, the developer of Call of Duty. The original Halo Studios (formerly 343 Industries) will be scaled down into a small team primarily responsible for supporting the player community. Activision President Rob Kostich stated that the goal is to create the greatest Halo game ever and has begun assembling a dedicated team to achieve this ambitious objective. Furthermore, Activision will take over the historic Rare studio (known for the Assassin's Creed franchise) and the Empire's Journey series managed by World's Edge. This restructuring reflects a comprehensive 'reset' and structural adjustment within Xbox's gaming division.",
