    title: "Rust 前端專案 (gccrs) 報告進度：討論編譯 Linux 核心的現況與未來規劃",
    summary: "本文報導 Pierre-Emmanuel Patry 和 Arthur Cohen 在 RustConf 2026 上發表的演講內容，主要聚焦於 Rust 語言的 GCC 前端專案 (gccrs) 的發展現況。gccrs 的目標是讓 Rust 能夠編譯 Linux 核心，這對於提升 Rust 在系統級程式開發的應用至關重要。雖然專案整體進展良好，但演講指出，要達到可用的編譯器狀態，仍需要一段時間的努力與時間。這項工作對於系統開發者和資安研究人員具有高度參考價值，預示著 Rust 在核心層級的應用將持續推進。",
    tags: ["Rust", "gccrs", "Linux 核心", "編譯器", "系統程式開發"],
    title_en: "Rust Frontend Project (gccrs) Report Progress: Discussing the Current Status and Future Plans for Compiling the Linux Kernel",
    summary_en: "This article reports on the presentation given by Pierre-Emmanuel Patry and Arthur Cohen at RustConf 2026, which primarily focuses on the development status of the Rust GCC frontend project (gccrs). The goal of gccrs is to enable Rust to compile the Linux kernel, which is crucial for enhancing Rust's application in system-level programming development. Although the project shows overall good progress, the presentation noted that achieving a usable compiler state will still require significant effort and time. This work holds high reference value for system developers and cybersecurity researchers, indicating that Rust's application at the core level will continue to advance.",
    tags_en: ["Rust", "gccrs", "Linux Kernel", "Compiler", "System Programming"],
    sources: [
      { name: "LWN.net", url: "https://lwn.net/Articles/1095553", lang: "EN" }
    ]
