    id: "20260922-12679",
    trackers: ["eu_cra"],
    category: "產業動態",
    title: "TP-Link 在 APAC B2B Summit 2026 首度發表 Wi-Fi 8 與 Omada 平台，推動網路與 AI 整合",
    summary: "全球網路與智慧家庭設備企業 TP-Link 在於斯里汶（KLCC）舉辦的 APAC B2B Summit 2026 上，正式發表了 Wi-Fi 8，並展示了其下一代無線連接策略。Wi-Fi 8 基於 IEEE 802.11bn 標準，結合自研的『Wi-Fi 8 StabilityEngine』，旨在提升網路在複雜環境下的覆蓋範圍與連接穩定性。本次活動除了推出 Archer 8 Ultra 路由器和 Deco 8 Ultra Mesh Wi-Fi 系統外，更首次展示了 Omada Wi-Fi 8 平台。此外，TP-Link 強調網路、影像監控與 AI 的整合趨勢，推出了 Fusion 系列產品，結合 Omada Network 的 SDN 技術和 Omada Guard 的 VMS 功能，實現單一環境管理。公司還宣布建立『Omada-VIGI AI Application Developer Alliance』，旨在將其網路和影像監控技術與 AI 應用結合，為教育、零售、製造等各產業提供客製化解決方案。",
    tags: ["TP-Link", "Wi-Fi 8", "Omada", "AI", "網路安全", "B2B", "IEEE 802.11bn"],
    title_en: "TP-Link Unveils Wi-Fi 8 and Omada Platform at APAC B2B Summit 2026, Driving Network and AI Integration",
    summary_en: "Global networking and smart home equipment company TP-Link officially unveiled Wi-Fi 8 at the APAC B2B Summit 2026 held in Kuala Lumpur (KLCC), showcasing its next-generation wireless connectivity strategy. Wi-Fi 8, based on the IEEE 802.11bn standard and combined with its proprietary 'Wi-Fi 8 StabilityEngine,' aims to enhance network coverage and connection stability in complex environments. In addition to launching the Archer 8 Ultra router and Deco 8 Ultra Mesh Wi-Fi system, TP-Link also debuted the Omada Wi-Fi 8 platform. Furthermore, TP-Link emphasized the integration trend of networking, video surveillance, and AI, introducing the Fusion series of products. These products combine Omada Network's SDN technology with Omada Guard's VMS functionality, enabling single-environment management. The company also announced the establishment of the 'Omada-VIGI AI Application Developer Alliance,' which aims to integrate its networking and video surveillance technologies with AI applications, providing customized solutions for various industries such as education, retail, and manufacturing.",
    tags_en: ["TP-Link", "Wi-Fi 8", "Omada", "AI", "Network Security", "B2B", "IEEE 802.11bn"],
    sources: [
      { name: "Boannews 韓國", url: "https://boannews.com/news/articleView.html?idxno=145989", lang: "EN" }
    ]
